  <description>
    <p>
      65C02 SIM is a cycle-accurate 65C02 microcomputer emulator and integrated development
      environment modeled after the Ben Eater 6502 memory architecture and extended with
      modern retro-computing peripherals.
    </p>
    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Full hardware simulation of the WDC 65C02 CPU, W65C22 VIA, 6551 ACIA, MOS 6581/8580 SID audio synthesizer, custom GPU with CRT shader support, SPI SD Card, and ESP8266 Wi-Fi interface.</li>
      <li>Built-in C and 6502 Assembly IDE powered by the bundled LLVM-MOS compiler toolchain, with live diagnostics, disassembly, and symbol inspection.</li>
      <li>Time-Travel Debugger, cycle-level logic analyzer, subroutine profiler, and interactive SID and MIDI studio tools.</li>
      <li>Support for distributable .65c cartridges bundling ROMs, VRAM images, and FAT16 SD card images.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
